    "ui.3104676152cd": "Record interpretation",
    "ui.cedd0df573d9": "Interpretation ledger",
    "ui.d9718b81ca49": "Locator / page / line / sheet / DOI",
    "ui.727fee0abc65": "Confidence (separate from evidence)",
    "ui.d29f46772c4a": "Reviewer",
    "ui.820886311160": "Standards validation",
    "ui.9913c1fbde6b": "Inspect a local Darwin Core review draft, Camtrap DP 1.0.2 ZIP, RO-Crate 1.3 preservation ZIP or EML 2.2.0 XML. Validation uses vendored schemas and local payload checks. Nothing is fetched remotely. These checks never change sources or interpretations.",
    "ui.c4621ae96aff": "Validate local package",
    "ui.55c9f76e3c14": "Standards ZIP or EML XML",
    "ui.d31099132fa4": "Current-project checks apply official Camtrap field/type/vocabulary/key rules to explicitly named deployments/media/observations. They do not invent package metadata or convert unrelated survey tables.",
    "ui.5c09793eb11e": "Coverage and limits",
    "ui.ab99f693bfb7": "XML/CSV members are limited to 20 MiB; 100,000 records/table, 250 columns. ZIP guards reject unsafe paths/expansion. This validator does not fetch external media or schema URLs.",
    "ui.6d415dba578c": "EML: full local 2.2.0 XSD grammar. Scientific completeness and reference-ID consistency remain separate review.",
    "ui.480a3effd988": "Camtrap: official descriptor JSON Schema plus implemented field presence, literal types, vocabulary/range/pattern/unique and foreign-key rules. Complete media/semantic conformance is not certified.",
    "ui.3f6f293f3916": "Frictionless: existing official descriptor/schema validation is included in preservation exports.",
    "ui.94db05420f8e": "Darwin Core DP 1.0: normative profile endpoint unavailable (404); the repository profile is 1.0-DEV. No substitution or compliance claim.",
    "ui.346e8c2533f8": "DwC-A and full RO-Crate profile validation remain pending. See docs/STANDARDS_V04.md.",
    "ui.7df20d0506bb": "Scientific validity is not established by structural validation.",
    "ui.0a4c3c3ed649": "RESEARCH SOFTWARE \xB7 PRE-RELEASE",
    "ui.f711a98fd4b2": "Recover \u2192 Preserve \u2192 Inspect \u2192 Understand \u2192 Relate \u2192 Document \u2192 Verify \u2192 Repair \u2192 Map \u2192 Validate \u2192 Package \u2192 Archive.",
    "ui.5801fc9f0f4f": "Keep scientific meaning, evidence and uncertainty together. Core processing is local to this computer; no telemetry, map tiles, taxonomy lookups or AI services are contacted.",
    "ui.c620e2391c2d": "Source license has not been selected by the project owner. Third-party schema license is included in vendor/schemas/LICENSE.md. Do not assume dataset reuse rights.",
    "ui.bd4be43491fb": "Documentation: README.md; docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, STANDARDS.md, PRIVACY.md, SECURITY.md and COMPLETION_V04.md in the application folder.",
    "ui.15a200a01e2b": "Normal rescue remains memory-bounded to 20 MiB sources / 100,000 rows per table. Streaming investigation supports audited cell edits; repairs and relational work still use normal rescue projects. Local EML XSD and Camtrap descriptor/table checks are available in Standards validation. Complete biodiversity-profile semantics and DwC-DP/RO-Crate conformance remain pending.",
    "ui.049b7fc0d148": "Keyboard reference",
    "ui.765d2ec55a3d": "Alt+Shift+P: commands. Alt+Shift+V: validation. Alt+Shift+S: snapshots. Tab / Shift+Tab: controls. Enter/Space: activate. Browser shortcuts remain available.",
    "ui.5964f24b0b23": "Disk-backed editing path: chunks \u2192 incremental SHA-256 \u2192 background CSV parsing \u2192 SQLite \u2192 bounded pages. Edit literal values with a rationale, undo/redo, and download a separate JSONL audit. Bulk transformations and rich large-project packaging remain pending. Limits: 256 MiB, 2 million records, 250 fields, 1 MiB per field; actual tested sizes are in the performance report.",
