    "ui.c256eed04084": "Committed changes always save to local disk. Metadata forms have separate recovery drafts. Keep an independent backup; recovery files on this device are not archival backups.",
    "ui.c11a88cff23a": "Saving, recovery & notifications",
    "ui.469331324a6f": "Errors stay visible until another notice. Optional encrypted backups are available in Export; ordinary local files and drafts remain unencrypted.",
    "ui.e2911cab7c61": "Import & validation defaults",
    "ui.3f030e91aaec": "Defaults are starting choices, not confirmed scientific metadata. Public export always requires reviewing its preview; meaningful edits always require a rationale.",
