    "ui.06db1c455e41": "Inferred types and potential identifiers describe the current values. They do not establish what a field means. Sorting and filtering only change this view.",
    "ui.91d9c0af87da": "Keep Unknown, Inferred and Conflicting interpretations visible. Evidence can be an attached protocol or an external reference. External references are stored as text; the app never fetches them.",
    "ui.cb98211f5ae7": "Validation has layers: file preservation, table/schema structure, relationships, metadata, standards mappings, and scientific warning signs. A technically valid table can still be scientifically wrong.",
    "ui.f5598a7daada": "The preservation package contains originals, evidence and private history. A public coordinate export omits those private materials and applies coordinate redaction or explicit rounding to copies only.",
