    "v062.tour.overview.title": "Find your next step",
    "v062.tour.overview.text": "Overview separates preserved files, documented meaning and issues needing review. Its suggestions are optional; scientific quality is not a single score.",
    "v062.tour.review.title": "Keep uncertainty visible",
    "v062.tour.review.text": "Review one issue or select a small batch. Intentionally unresolved is a valid outcome. An Accepted organizational review never changes scientific meaning.",
    "v062.tour.translation.title": "Preview an evidence-backed translation",
    "v062.tour.translation.text": "Choose the recorded field and convention, record your confirmation basis and preview the result. Derived fields keep original values and row-level unresolved outcomes.",
    "v062.tour.evidence.title": "Record supporting and competing evidence",
    "v062.tour.evidence.text": "Keep evidence assertions separate from field definitions. Record a locator and rationale, and preserve competing interpretations instead of silently choosing one.",
    "v062.tour.validation.title": "Check declared rules",
    "v062.tour.validation.text": "Validation finds errors, warnings and information. Passing checks does not prove scientific correctness, and export-blocking errors cannot be hidden by display filters.",
    "v062.tour.export.title": "Prepare a durable package",
    "v062.tour.export.text": "Inspect the public sensitivity policy or prepare a private preservation package. Originals, dictionary, audit and recipes have different preservation roles.",
