    "v0618.action": "Review a projected coordinate pair",
    "v0618.safety": "Select the recorded easting field above and its northing partner below. Establish the source CRS, units and axis order from retained evidence before converting. New latitude/longitude fields retain the original pair. Unknown systems are valid unresolved outcomes; no CRS, swapped axis or unit is guessed.",
    "v0618.pairedColumn": "Recorded northing field",
