    "v0618.unknownAxes": "Axis order / units not established",
    "v0618.eastNorthMetres": "Selected field is easting; partner is northing; both in metres",
    "v0618.evidenceSafety": "EPSG:3857 conversion requires evidence-based review, a retained source locator and reviewer. Output is separate WGS 84 latitude/longitude in decimal degrees. This is an inverse projection, not a datum-grid or epoch transformation and not proof of measured accuracy.",
    "v0618.bounds": "Only the reviewed EPSG:3857 square web-map extent \xB120,037,508.342789244 metres is implemented. Complete tables are limited to 100,000 rows. Unsupported, missing, invalid or out-of-extent pairs produce blank derived coordinates with explicit outcomes; source values remain literal. Numeric output uses up to 15 significant digits without asserting that the measurement has that precision.",
    "v0618.privacy": "Applying this review marks both recorded coordinate inputs and both derived coordinate fields as sensitive in the audited working metadata. Public exports then suppress them under the existing sensitivity rules; private originals remain exact.",
