    "ui.ee0f32af51f4": "Open Sources and read",
    "ui.e836520126d3": "Kan\u0131tlar\u0131n her alan\u0131 a\xE7\u0131klamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 unutmay\u0131n.",
    "ui.07b63476df85": "\u0130li\u015Fkilerde \xF6nerilen obs \u2192 olaylar\u0131 linkini g\xF6zden ge\xE7irin. Olay tan\u0131mlay\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 olarak do\u011Frulay\u0131n; E404 ve E03 olay\u0131n\u0131 inceledi.",
    "ui.82b859b47c50": "Metadata'da, kurtarma",
    "ui.f8682f8c115b": "Protokolde a\xE7\u0131klanan g\xF6rsel say\u0131 olarak Set durumu Onayland\u0131 ve bu protokol\xFC kan\u0131t olarak ekleyin. Keep",
    "ui.9cf9f50925b2": "Bilinmeyen.",
    "ui.ff910fb28c15": "Onar\u0131mda, beyaz uzay\u0131 k\u0131r\u0131n. NA kongreyi normalle\u015Ftirmeden \xF6nce do\u011Frulay\u0131n; s\u0131f\u0131r ayr\u0131 tutun.",
    "ui.c0b1f0e7587c": "B\xFCy\xFCk tarihler ve imkans\u0131z koordinatlar. Protokol yerel veya datum tahmin etmemi\u015Ftir.",
    "ui.8dab7ac43643": "Ge\xE7erlilik ve koruma paketi ihra\xE7 edin. Sonra bir koordinat-redacted public paketi test edin.",
