    "ui.93e1e1234a43": "\u0130\u015F alan\u0131 modunuzu se\xE7in",
    "ui.202c3e907b32": "Yeni ba\u015Flayanlar, i\u015F ak\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131 a\xE7\u0131klar. Uzman tam \u015Femalar\u0131 ve teknik detaylar\u0131 ortaya \xE7\u0131kar\u0131r. Bilimsel proje ayn\u0131 kal\u0131r. devam etmek i\xE7in her t\xFCrl\xFC modu se\xE7in.",
