    "ui.6a85d53279b1": "Click or drop a source here here",
    "ui.8dd9a213b0e7": "Bu kutuyu bir veri k\xFCmesi veya kan\u0131tlar\u0131 se\xE7mek i\xE7in kullan\u0131n.The \xF6nizleme orijinal de\u011Ferleri tutar.Bu turu dosyan\u0131z\u0131 se\xE7menize haz\u0131r oldu\u011Funda kapat\u0131n.",
    "ui.0d907a988cb8": "B\xD6RT \xB7 {p0} / {p1}",
