    "msg.294f8e3fa2a9": "Geni\u015Flenen i\u015F kitab\u0131 100 MiB'yi a\u015F\u0131yor.",
    "msg.f44bd56bd941": "Bi\xE7imlendirme, grafikler, g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCler, iplik yorumlar\u0131, \xF6nemli tablolar, d\u0131\u015F ba\u011Flant\u0131lar ve g\xF6m\xFCl\xFC nesneler orijinal i\u015F kitab\u0131nda kal\u0131r; tabular verilere d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFClemez.",
