    "ui.ab61ad545d4b": "Projeleriniz, onlar\u0131 a\xE7\u0131k\xE7a ihra\xE7 etmedi\u011Finiz s\xFCrece bu cihazda kal\u0131yor.",
    "ui.dfbbec38fc54": "Yerel \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma alan\u0131",
