    "ui.31a2c4fad946": "Verileri yararl\u0131 k\u0131lan ba\u011Flam i\xE7in in\u015Fa edilmi\u015Ftir.",
    "ui.3ea81536eeca": "Yerel disk \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma alan\u0131 \xB7 Ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z bir yedekleme",
    "ui.06f87d114e26": "PRESERVE \u0130LK",
    "ui.bc8a24e4fc5d": "Bir veri k\xFCmesini odaklamaya geri getirin",
    "ui.e68710b4e310": "Close import",
    "ui.ec7d9b9efcd2": "Orijinal dosyan\u0131z sa\u011Flam kal\u0131r. Bir kurtarma ba\u015Flamadan \xF6nce nas\u0131l okunaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 onaylay\u0131n.",
    "ui.89e3f72fb955": "Bir kaynak dosyas\u0131 se\xE7in",
    "ui.04cf47804f92": "Veriler veya kan\u0131tlar\u0131 destekler \xB7 20 MiB",
    "ui.375ef41d353d": "Kan\u0131tlar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca destekleyen olarak koruma; tablolar\u0131 \xE7\u0131karma.",
