    "v064.error.LARGE_BATCH_HISTORY": "Kapal\u0131 bir de\u011Fer kay\u0131tl\u0131 tarihinden farkl\u0131d\u0131r. Undo veya redo bloke edildi ve tam i\u015Flem geri al\u0131nd\u0131.",
