    "v0614.title": "Legacy Excel kurtarma",
    "v0614.cachedSafety": "Sadece \xF6nbellekli \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma masas\u0131 de\u011Ferleri geri al\u0131nd\u0131. Formula metin ve form\xFCl kan\u0131tlanm\u0131\u015F de\u011Fildi; \xF6nbellekli sonu\xE7lar eksik veya durgun olabilir. Hi\xE7bir makro veya form\xFCller \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131.",
    "v0614.serialSafety": "Tarihler say\u0131sal seriler olarak kal\u0131r. Kay\u0131t tarihi sistemini sadece orijinal \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma kitab\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6zden ge\xE7irdikten sonra kullan\u0131n; hi\xE7bir takvim tarihi ertelenmedi.",
