    "v0614.bounds": "Kurtarma 100 \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma masas\u0131na ba\u011Fl\u0131d\u0131r, 250 s\xFCtun, 500.000 h\xFCcre, on milyon de\u011Fer karakter, 20 saniye ve 256 MiB s\xFCreci haf\u0131za. Ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z veya uzun bir \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma kitab\u0131 k\u0131smi bir masa olmadan korunmu\u015Ftur.",
    "v0614.unsupported": "Grafikler, yorumlar, hiperlinkler, d\u0131\u015F ba\u011Flant\u0131lar, g\xF6m\xFCl\xFC nesneler ve i\u015F kitab\u0131 d\xFCzeni orijinalinde muhafaza edilir; bu sad\u0131k \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma kitab\u0131 yeniden in\u015Fa de\u011Fildir.",
